WEBVTT

00:05:55.807 --> 00:06:01.073
and that one moment
has expanded in my mind

00:06:01.097 --> 00:06:02.518
to fill that entire year.

00:06:02.542 --> 00:06:05.717
So we don't experience time
in minutes and seconds.

00:06:05.741 --> 00:06:09.577
So this is a still
of the video that I took,

00:06:09.601 --> 00:06:11.371
printed out on a piece of paper,

00:06:11.395 --> 00:06:14.869
the paper is torn and then the video
is projected on top of it.

00:06:15.323 --> 00:06:17.028
And I wanted to play with this idea

00:06:17.052 --> 00:06:20.910
of how, in this kind of
complete immersion of images

00:06:20.934 --> 00:06:22.776
that's enveloped us,

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.697
how one image can actually grow

00:06:26.721 --> 00:06:28.329
and can haunt us.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.284
So I had all of these --